Dependencies
================================================================================

This component is a repackaging of the upstream OAuth2 Proxy container image.
The Dockerfile adds only an NVIDIA-authored `error.html` and this NOTICE; no
third-party source is compiled here.

| Artifact | Version | License | License source |
|----------|---------|---------|----------------|
| `quay.io/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy` | v7.15.3 | MIT | https://github.com/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy/blob/v7.15.3/LICENSE |

The upstream image bundles its own third-party dependencies. Their attributions
are those published by the OAuth2 Proxy project for the v7.15.3 release and are
redistributed unmodified inside that image; this component neither alters nor
adds to them.

